                                                "sense_id": "fbba2cc4-b5b4-3b48-b31b-569deabbdfc2",
                                                "text": "It was in vain that the bishop published a new papal brief, declaring valid the excommunications which he had issued, and those of the inquisitors to be null, and requiring them to seek absolution from him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad177f12-f6ee-3825-b198-7258083cdb94",
