                                                "sense_id": "201a3cc5-61ef-3c1e-87c7-cad7bb755966",
                                                "text": "[…] euen ſo it fareth with mee, who béeing about to anatomize Abſurditie, am vrged to take a view of ſundry mens vanitie, a ſuruey of their follie, a briefe of their barbariſme […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ca269e7-cd1c-4f94-b98c-586cb064681e",
                                                "sense_id": "201a3cc5-61ef-3c1e-87c7-cad7bb755966",
                                                "text": "EACH woman is a brief of womankind, / And doth in little e’en as much contain, / As in one day and night all life we find ; / Of either more is but the ſame again […]"
                                            }
