                                                "sense_id": "bd5bd5f6-b007-3097-b000-044b8bef4e14",
                                                "text": "The U.S. president was briefed on the military coup and its implications on African stability."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89a81d53-44c8-459d-ad55-2bbfa921b0c8",
